  "title": "Too dark on KDE",
  "date": "2026-09-15T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Too dark on KDE\n\nIt is a problem for me in years. That on Linux, especially KDE desktop, my screen is always darken. I always thought it was the HDR problem.\n\nTurns out it was the driver's problem. I use brightnessctl set 100%, then the screen is as bright as it is on Windows.",
